SUAREZ v. PRAIRIE GRILL HOLDINGS, INC. - EXECUTED SETTLEMENT (SIMULATED)

Fund: $9,750,000 covering 8,400 class members. Effective Date: 2025-08-01.

Section 6 (Injunctive Relief) - due within 45 days of the Effective Date:
(a) a biometric retention-and-destruction policy posted publicly on the company website;
(b) a statute-compliant written-release consent form for all active employees;
(c) a vendor contract amendment requiring certified destruction of templates within 30 days of a company request.
